{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>八鄉發生火警。今日（3日）晚上10時許，警方接報數名市民報案，錦上路、元崗村對開一個垃圾收集站突然冒煙起火，消防接報到場將火撲熄，正調查起火原因。事件中，無人受傷。</p><p>根據網上圖片，現場火光熊熊，數名站在對面行人路的途人駐足觀望火勢。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場火光熊熊，數名站在對面行人路的途人駐足觀望火勢。（Facebook群組「錦上路之友」圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194430756860989440530816.jpeg/1dySoePvvQKZft2Ow0hukc92pVM2dbK6NfYHEDX2BxA\"/><figcaption>現場火光熊熊，數名站在對面行人路的途人駐足觀望火勢。（Facebook群組「錦上路之友」圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:41:32.721026+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":164,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:34:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T22:58:43.656453+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:38:44.865771+00:00","content_hash":"705ad2cdbf099d8410921274543f514743f602ab9e10967a31eea3e5dee7dba1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}